{"2973250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Theurgy Architect", "steam_appid": 2973250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/c155291fb6317d997c0ba85f659e0972.poster.avif?t=1742768552\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/c155291fb6317d997c0ba85f659e0972.webm?t=1742768552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/c155291fb6317d997c0ba85f659e0972.mp4?t=1742768552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to wield the power of creation?</strong> In Theurgy City, <i>you</i> are the divine architect. With just a touch, reshape the land and watch as your intelligent citizens build a thriving metropolis around your will.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Command:</strong> No complex menus or micromanaging - your power comes from simple, intuitive spells. Change the terrain, unlock new areas, and guide the growth of your city with every tap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/4c1cba5f32a8f90fb75d046c6bcaa749.poster.avif?t=1742768552\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/4c1cba5f32a8f90fb75d046c6bcaa749.webm?t=1742768552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/4c1cba5f32a8f90fb75d046c6bcaa749.mp4?t=1742768552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Possibilities:</strong> Discover the magic of dynamic building. How will you shape the landscape? Will it be soaring towers reaching for the heavens or sprawling marketplaces teeming with life? Every decision brings a unique vision to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/dc70c8b6f36e4ba2279307935f650e97.poster.avif?t=1742768552\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/dc70c8b6f36e4ba2279307935f650e97.webm?t=1742768552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/dc70c8b6f36e4ba2279307935f650e97.mp4?t=1742768552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer &amp; Expand:</strong> Face challenges head-on, banish those who stand against your city's progress, and claim new territories to expand your dominion. Each victory strengthens your legacy as Theurgy City's ruler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/f003e1fb981203abafcb7f49e7c87556.poster.avif?t=1742768552\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/f003e1fb981203abafcb7f49e7c87556.webm?t=1742768552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/f003e1fb981203abafcb7f49e7c87556.mp4?t=1742768552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your masterpiece. Build your legend.</strong> Download Theurgy City now and unleash the god within!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/f4959648b3b6f6fac5de7fe7ee15f118.poster.avif?t=1742768552\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/f4959648b3b6f6fac5de7fe7ee15f118.webm?t=1742768552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/f4959648b3b6f6fac5de7fe7ee15f118.mp4?t=1742768552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/c155291fb6317d997c0ba85f659e0972.poster.avif?t=1742768552\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/c155291fb6317d997c0ba85f659e0972.webm?t=1742768552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/c155291fb6317d997c0ba85f659e0972.mp4?t=1742768552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to wield the power of creation?</strong> In Theurgy City, <i>you</i> are the divine architect. With just a touch, reshape the land and watch as your intelligent citizens build a thriving metropolis around your will.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Command:</strong> No complex menus or micromanaging - your power comes from simple, intuitive spells. Change the terrain, unlock new areas, and guide the growth of your city with every tap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.st